    {
      "key": "ai.help",
      "value": "> HELLO      - Greet the AI\n> MEANING    - Life, the universe, and hay\n> MATRIX     - Red pill or blue pill?\n> FORCE      - Jedi farming advice\n> GORDON     - Half-Life but with grass\n> DOOM       - Rip and tear, agriculturally\n> GTA        - Wanted level: farmer\n> SIMS       - Moodlet: MOWING\n> TERMINATOR - I'll be bale\n> MINECRAFT  - Have you tried punching it?\n> PORTAL     - The bale is a lie\n> WITCHER    - Toss a coin to your farmer\n> AMONG      - The grass is sus\n> SHREK      - The field has layers\n> RAMSAY     - Where is the lamb sauce?\n> SENTIENT   - Am I alive? (inconclusive)\n> CAT        - The cat knows things\n> CHICKEN    - Poultry-based evasion tactics\n> MONEY      - Financial advice from 1987\n> BALE       - The sacred art of baling\n> WEATHER    - Forecast: grass, with a chance of hay\n> TAX        - Topic terminated for your safety\n> WORK       - Status: in progress\n> DOCTOR     - Medical advice from a barn computer\n> ERROR      - Have you tried turning the field off?\n> UPDATE     - Last updated: harvest season 1987\n> FRIENDS    - Misery loves company and mowing\n> BANANA     - Not a farming question but fine\n> PIZZA      - Grass is not edible. We checked.\n> TIME       - The grass does not care\n> SECRET     - [REDACTED]\n> XYZZY      - A hollow voice says PLUGH\n> KONAMI     - You know what you are doing\n> INFO       - About this game\n> BACK       - Return to the cheat console"
